20260716 miner_2 cycle: clean independent VIX-beta retest completed. Defensive factor = -rolling covariance(asset daily return, VIX return)/rolling VIX-return variance, 60 sessions (min 45), exact date-aligned production construction. Across 2020-01-01 to 2026-07-15, 15 instruments, 1,596 daily cross-sectional IC dates, average 14.63 valid names, coverage 94.93%, low rank turnover 0.0434; daily IC +0.02338 but ICIR +0.05495, below daily admission gates IC >=0.007 and ICIR >=0.084. Horizon IC/ICIR: 5d +0.06298/+0.1544 (1,592 dates), 10d +0.08984/+0.2184 (1,588 dates), but these do not substitute for daily paper gates. Regime means were positive 2020/21, negative 2022, positive 2023/24, near-zero/negative 2025/26, indicating recent decay. Window robustness weak: 20d daily ICIR .0255, 40d .0409, 90d .0573, 120d .0423. Pooled correlations to reversal 5d -0.041 and momentum 20d +0.054; independent but failed daily ICIR. No persistence or ensemble change; no holdings/live actions due warm-up freeze.
20260716 miner_2 cycle: downside reward ratio explored, defined trailing 20d mean positive return divided by mean absolute negative return using only completed data. Correct date-aligned run: 1,670 daily IC dates, average 14.54 valid instruments, coverage 72.05%, rank turnover 0.2959. Daily IC +0.00539, ICIR +0.01653, hit 50.18%, failed both admission gates (IC below .007 and ICIR below .084). 5d IC/ICIR +0.02432/+0.07444 also below ICIR; 10d +0.05125/+0.15499 is non-admission horizon evidence. Regime daily IC means 2020 .0150, 2021 .0054, 2022 .0205, 2023 -.0161, 2024 -.0094, 2025 .0044, 2026 .0301. Pooled correlations: -0.374 with reversal, +0.705 with momentum, +0.150 with CLV; no persistence. Initial script had calendar concat misalignment yielding only 255 dates; corrected to per-asset date-aligned construction. No ensemble changes; warm-up frozen.

